(3880180, 550523, 57032, '<td valign="top">A picture with some emotion! Thank you!<br/> <br/>Roses are a bit OOF, but the face isn''t. Good job.</td>', 'A picture with some emotion! Thank you! Roses are a bit OOF, but the face isn''t. Good job.', '2007-07-08 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880181, 550377, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOODNESSSSS!!!!  Technically lacking, but the cute factor is certainly there.  What sweeties.</td>', 'OH MY GOODNESSSSS!!!!  Technically lacking, but the cute factor is certainly there.  What sweeties.', '2007-07-08 01:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880183, 550523, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  I think since the "subject" is supposed to be the flowers, it might''ve been better if they were in focus and she were slightly blurred. The colours and composition are well done.</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  I think since the "subject" is supposed to be the flowers, it might''ve been better if they were in focus and she were slightly blurred. The colours and composition are well done.', '2007-07-08 01:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880187, 550610, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very, very clever. Seven sticks! I really like this shot. There''s not much to judge for technicals (although the flash isn''t blown out, which is good), but the idea and execution gets you a 10 from me.</td>', 'Very, very clever. Seven sticks! I really like this shot. There''s not much to judge for technicals (although the flash isn''t blown out, which is good), but the idea and execution gets you a 10 from me.', '2007-07-08 01:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880188, 550554, 61818, '<td valign="top">So the subject of the shot is the background?  That''s the only place I''m seeing 7 of anything.  If I have to work hard to count 7 of something on the subject (especially when it''s supposed to be 7 [i]of]/i] the subject) then I''m thinking what might have been a fine concept did not translate so well when executed...</td>', 'So the subject of the shot is the background?  That''s the only place I''m seeing 7 of anything.  If I have to work hard to count 7 of something on the subject (especially when it''s supposed to be 7 [i]of]/i] the subject) then I''m thinking what might have been a fine concept did not translate so well when executed...', '2007-07-08 01:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880192, 550096, 31637, '<td valign="top">I is pronounced, and the others are out of focus, good try.</td>', 'I is pronounced, and the others are out of focus, good try.', '2007-07-08 01:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880193, 550447, 71558, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Cool shot. Nice lighting.', '2007-07-08 01:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880195, 550529, 18367, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting in this image quite harsh and the the focus seems a tad off.  The smudge on the lower left hand side of the image, and the specks on the lower right detract from the overall quality of this image.  <br/> <br/>Also, considering the reddish hue of the apparatus on display, you might have been better served to use a backdrop of a different colour to accentuate the subject of your image.<br/> <br/>I do admire your fortitude for displaying an image of this type, but I do fear that some of the more conservative elements will penalize you with their score.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you.</td>', 'I find the lighting in this image quite harsh and the the focus seems a tad off.  The smudge on the lower left hand side of the image, and the specks on the lower right detract from the overall quality of this image.   Also, considering the reddish hue of the apparatus on display, you might have been better served to use a backdrop of a different colour to accentuate the subject of your image. I do admire your fortitude for displaying an image of this type, but I do fear that some of the more conservative elements will penalize you with their score. Best of luck to you.', '2007-07-08 01:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880196, 550577, 71558, '<td valign="top">That''s really cool. The colors and lighting are really nice.</td>', 'That''s really cool. The colors and lighting are really nice.', '2007-07-08 01:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3880198, 550439, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The silhouette is stunning.  I don''t know if this is happenstance or forced, but whatever.... just a lovely tribute to Mother Nature.</td>', 'Lovely.  The silhouette is stunning.  I don''t know if this is happenstance or forced, but whatever.... just a lovely tribute to Mother Nature.', '2007-07-08 01:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
