(3880281, 550247, 57032, '<td valign="top">Pretty messy at the top (compression artifacts), and the image doesn''t seem to fit the competition. At least 8 glasses are visible, and both the setup and the title seem forced to simply fit the challenge''s requirements.<br/> <br/>From a technical standpoint, the flash is distracting in the glasses. Off-camera or bounce flash would have been more effective.</td>', 'Pretty messy at the top (compression artifacts), and the image doesn''t seem to fit the competition. At least 8 glasses are visible, and both the setup and the title seem forced to simply fit the challenge''s requirements. From a technical standpoint, the flash is distracting in the glasses. Off-camera or bounce flash would have been more effective.', '2007-07-08 01:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
