(3881767, 550475, 2667, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, cause i love taking pics of food... and I love peppers and a I love tomatoes, but there is too much going on here and the shadows are a bit harsh. This photo could have been much better, I think, if the tomoatoes had been cut open (then they wouldnt look like jelly beans) and there not quite so much pepper everywhere. Also could have benefited from a more angled approach rather than straight down.</td>', 'i like the idea, cause i love taking pics of food... and I love peppers and a I love tomatoes, but there is too much going on here and the shadows are a bit harsh. This photo could have been much better, I think, if the tomoatoes had been cut open (then they wouldnt look like jelly beans) and there not quite so much pepper everywhere. Also could have benefited from a more angled approach rather than straight down.', '2007-07-08 12:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3881790, 550553, 2667, '<td valign="top">interesting composition. i like the angles, but the shadows are distracting.</td>', 'interesting composition. i like the angles, but the shadows are distracting.', '2007-07-08 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3881806, 550215, 2667, '<td valign="top">very interesting idea, but while the red gloves add a lot of visual impact to the thumbnail they don''t do anything but detract from the full sized pic. The dark shadows underneath and blown out reds aren''t that appealing. The skin tones and the body painting, however, are great.</td>', 'very interesting idea, but while the red gloves add a lot of visual impact to the thumbnail they don''t do anything but detract from the full sized pic. The dark shadows underneath and blown out reds aren''t that appealing. The skin tones and the body painting, however, are great.', '2007-07-08 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
