(3882071, 550389, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal line. I might run the sharpen tool over each individual droplet - but not overdo it, just to give them that extra kick they deserve.  I love the smell of pine. Makes me think of Christmas. Nice bokeh. 6</td>', 'I like the diagonal line. I might run the sharpen tool over each individual droplet - but not overdo it, just to give them that extra kick they deserve.  I love the smell of pine. Makes me think of Christmas. Nice bokeh. 6', '2007-07-08 14:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
