(3882368, 550616, 39430, '<td valign="top">Something really wierd going on there with the DOF.  A tilt shift lens maybe?  The DOF is too shallow to work though.  The centre coins are all out of focus, while the front and back ones just make it slightly in focus, which messes with my head.  There''s also nothing else in the shot, so why not just use a closed aperture, and have them all in proper focus?</td>', 'Something really wierd going on there with the DOF.  A tilt shift lens maybe?  The DOF is too shallow to work though.  The centre coins are all out of focus, while the front and back ones just make it slightly in focus, which messes with my head.  There''s also nothing else in the shot, so why not just use a closed aperture, and have them all in proper focus?', '2007-07-08 16:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
