(3887937, 550484, 39349, '<td valign="top">Seriously? How cool is this? Very modern MC Escher feeling this shot gives off; that deserves nothing less than 10. If I had to nit pick about anything on this shot I would have to pick the vignette is a little too strong IMHO. <br/> <br/>(back for comments)</td>', 'Seriously? How cool is this? Very modern MC Escher feeling this shot gives off; that deserves nothing less than 10. If I had to nit pick about anything on this shot I would have to pick the vignette is a little too strong IMHO.  (back for comments)', '2007-07-10 02:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3887938, 550347, 39349, '<td valign="top">The softness of this shot really works well here. The warm tones pull you into this and help the viewer to relax. Great work, my only suggestion would be to tone the border down just a tad. <br/> <br/>(back for comments)</td>', 'The softness of this shot really works well here. The warm tones pull you into this and help the viewer to relax. Great work, my only suggestion would be to tone the border down just a tad.  (back for comments)', '2007-07-10 02:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
