(3887947, 550178, 39349, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect execution here, it''s just a tad blown out IMHO around the green and blue pencils. Still I give this an 8 for it''s vibrant colors and wonderful leading lines. <br/> <br/>(back for comments)</td>', 'Almost perfect execution here, it''s just a tad blown out IMHO around the green and blue pencils. Still I give this an 8 for it''s vibrant colors and wonderful leading lines.  (back for comments)', '2007-07-10 02:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
