(3899024, 550388, 67697, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I like the dark background - really helps the yellow pop out of the pic.  Personally, I would like to have seen just a little bit more cropped off the right side.</td>', 'Pretty.  I like the dark background - really helps the yellow pop out of the pic.  Personally, I would like to have seen just a little bit more cropped off the right side.', '2007-07-12 21:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
