(3904439, 550529, 62637, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by animal_lover:</b></div><hr/><i> what are those? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Here''s just one example of why I think photos like this should not be allowed and/or personal constraint used in a better manner. Big brother agrees! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I would think its an example of why pre-teens shouldn''t be allowed on DPC.  But thats just me...</td>', 'Originally posted by Blackbox: Originally posted by animal_lover: what are those?   Here''s just one example of why I think photos like this should not be allowed and/or personal constraint used in a better manner. Big brother agrees!   I would think its an example of why pre-teens shouldn''t be allowed on DPC.  But thats just me...', '2007-07-15 02:54:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3904450, 550484, 57032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scalvert:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i>looks like some controversy is brewing here already... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh, joy. :-/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Some people tend to get bitter when someone else comes up with a great idea, and their only reactive solution is to get controversial.<br/> <br/>You had an excellent idea, and it was perfectly done.<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Originally posted by scalvert: Originally posted by hotpasta:looks like some controversy is brewing here already...   Oh, joy. :-/   Some people tend to get bitter when someone else comes up with a great idea, and their only reactive solution is to get controversial. You had an excellent idea, and it was perfectly done. Great job.', '2007-07-15 03:04:23.000000', NULL, 0),
