(4319758, 550178, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of natural light with a bit of added artificial to create this look.  The softness works well, but I can imagine that a similar setup with a bit crisper focus would make this quite stock worthy.  Very nice shaping of the pencils - creates a soothing geometric design.  And again, the light is excellent here.  Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely use of natural light with a bit of added artificial to create this look.  The softness works well, but I can imagine that a similar setup with a bit crisper focus would make this quite stock worthy.  Very nice shaping of the pencils - creates a soothing geometric design.  And again, the light is excellent here.  Nice work.', '2007-12-18 01:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
